{# Title and icon
   Add a title to summarize the message and an icon to make it easier to spot.
   The content is then displayed as the description of the alert. #}
<twig:ea:Alert variant="warning" title="Your trial ends in 3 days" icon="internal:circle-exclamation">
    Add a payment method to keep using all the features of your account.
</twig:ea:Alert>
<twig:ea:Alert variant="info" icon="internal:circle-info">
    You can import customers from a CSV file.
</twig:ea:Alert>
